        "content": {
          "passageId": "english-pre-a1-m045-reading-passage-01",
          "passage": "Hello! This is Green Town. There is a school next to the park. There is a library near the station. The supermarket is on Main Street. A small shop is beside the hospital. Children play in the park after school. Green Town is a busy place, and the people like their town."
